"One call, a very long loop. The method is cold when entered, so tiering
 up requires ON-STACK REPLACEMENT: the loop must migrate to compiled code
 mid-flight, or it never compiles at all."
Object subclass: O [
    O class >> longSum: n [
        | s i |
        s := 0. i := 1.
        [ i <= n ] whileTrue: [ s := s + i. i := i + 1 ].
        ^s
    ]
]
Transcript showCr: (O longSum: 3000000) printString.
